 ed into becoming a sleeper assassin in a Communist conspiracy\, and a fell
 ow POW who slowly uncovers the sinister plot.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/prog
 rams-and-events/cold-war-summer/the-manchurian-candidate\n\nEstimated star
