SUMMARY:Band of Outsiders (1964)
DTSTART:20261022T020000Z
DTEND:20261022T035000Z
DTSTAMP:20261022T020000Z
UID:X5lfrHskLW
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nNouvelles FemmesGodard puts his a
 ppreciative-playful spin on Hollywood-style Noir. Two guys (Claude Brasseu
 r\, Sami Frey) team with a lovely\, naive\, doe-eyed language student (Ann
 a Karina) to steal money that’s hidden in her rooming house. Karina conv
 eys a woman coming into her exuberant selfhood. When the three line dance 
 the Madison\, she keeps going\, bouncing and smiling.\n\nhttps://www.siff.
 net/programs-and-events/nouvelles-femmes/band-of-outsiders\n\nEstimated st
 art: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
